ast used as a probiotic, known for its role in fermentation and health benefits.", "DIARREA ASOCIADA A ANTIBIÓTICOS:DIARREA ASOCIADA A ANTIBIÓTICOS (Antibiotic-Associated Diarrhea) is a condition that probiotics have shown potential benefits in treating.", "INFECCIÓN POR CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE:INFECCIÓN POR CLOSTRIDIUM DIFFICILE (Clostridium difficile infection) is a serious condition that probiotics may help manage, according to research.", "POUCHITIS:POUCHITIS is an inflammatory condition that can occur after surgery and is being studied for probiotic treatment options."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}